// "Surveil N" [CR#701.25a]: look at the top N cards of your library, then put
// any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library
// in any order. "Your" is the actor's; the slice is read back as scry's is
// (`lookAndSortSlice`). Surveil 0 makes no surveil event [CR#701.25c], which
// is the rules' to apply, as connive 0's is (`conniveN`).
KeywordAction(
    name: "surveil",
    params: [Amount],
    spelling: "surveil <Param(0)>",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "surveil",
        frame_set: MeasureComplement,
    ),
    body: lookAndSortSlice(slice(Top, Param(0), library(actor)), graveyard, []),
)
